    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\ud83e\uddd9\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Speed and freedom await\u00a0!\u00a0Get\u00a0ready\u00a0to invert ups &amp;\u00a0downs\u00a0as\u00a0you\u00a0wish\u00a0!\ud83e\uddd9\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2640\ufe0f</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing the\u00a0Universe\u00a0is\u00a0a fast-paced FPS runner where you\u00a0slide\u00a0in\u00a0space\u00a0and teleport\u00a0to gather the\u00a0stars.\u00a0Chase\u00a0behind the\u00a0universe within a saturated world to\u00a0clear gravity-defying levels as fast as you\u00a0can\u00a0! \u2728</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Speed and freedom \ud83c\udf0c</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gravity\u00a0to\u00a0define your path\u00a0to stay\u00a0fast ! Teleport\u00a0and align yourself to any\u00a0wall,\u00a0nothing\u00a0is\u00a0out\u00a0limit\u00a0!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udc4d Easy to\u00a0play\u00a0\ud83d\udc4d</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press shift to\u00a0slide, space\u00a0to jump and\u00a0left\u00a0click to\u00a0teleport\u00a0!\u00a0No\u00a0need to\u00a0worry, immerse yourself directly\u00a0in the\u00a0speed\u00a0and\u00a0freedom\u00a0!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83e\ude84 Establish records \ud83e\ude84</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the\u00a0level\u00a0at high\u00a0speed,\u00a0the\u00a0less time\u00a0the\u00a0better\u00a0your\u00a0rank\u00a0!\u00a0Aim\u00a0for the\u00a0golden\u00a0S, and maybe\u00a0even further\u00a0?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\ud83e\uddd9\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Speed and freedom await\u00a0!\u00a0Get\u00a0ready\u00a0to invert ups &amp;\u00a0downs\u00a0as\u00a0you\u00a0wish\u00a0!\ud83e\uddd9\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2640\ufe0f</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing the\u00a0Universe\u00a0is\u00a0a fast-paced FPS runner where you\u00a0slide\u00a0in\u00a0space\u00a0and teleport\u00a0to gather the\u00a0stars.\u00a0Chase\u00a0behind the\u00a0universe within a saturated world to\u00a0clear gravity-defying levels as fast as you\u00a0can\u00a0! \u2728</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Speed and freedom \ud83c\udf0c</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your gravity\u00a0to\u00a0define your path\u00a0to stay\u00a0fast ! Teleport\u00a0and align yourself to any\u00a0wall,\u00a0nothing\u00a0is\u00a0out\u00a0limit\u00a0!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83d\udc4d Easy to\u00a0play\u00a0\ud83d\udc4d</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press shift to\u00a0slide, space\u00a0to jump and\u00a0left\u00a0click to\u00a0teleport\u00a0!\u00a0No\u00a0need to\u00a0worry, immerse yourself directly\u00a0in the\u00a0speed\u00a0and\u00a0freedom\u00a0!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\ud83e\ude84 Establish records \ud83e\ude84</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the\u00a0level\u00a0at high\u00a0speed,\u00a0the\u00a0less time\u00a0the\u00a0better\u00a0your\u00a0rank\u00a0!\u00a0Aim\u00a0for the\u00a0golden\u00a0S, and maybe\u00a0even further\u00a0?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
